This repository is a modified version (fork) of the QRadar MCP Server above, maintained
for an AI SOC platform. The modifications are the fork/ package, snapshots/, tests/fork/,
tests/lab/, the CI workflow and changes to Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml, pyproject.toml,
.dockerignore, .gitignore and README.md.

T-040 also modifies these upstream Python tool files:
- tools/offense/add_offense_note.py: send note_text in a UTF-8 form body instead of the query string.
- tools/reference_data/get_reference_table.py: remove the filter argument from the schema and request.
- tools/reference_data/get_reference_map.py: remove the filter argument from the schema and request.

The corresponding upstream tests were updated in T-040:
- tests/tools/offense/test_add_offense_note.py
- tests/tools/reference_data/test_get_reference_table.py
- tests/tools/reference_data/test_get_reference_map.py

README.md lists what differs from upstream.
